MCQ Question Paper

Q1. Hard: What is the function of the `Archive Manager` regarding `.tar` vs `.tar.gz`?
A. .tar is compressed, .tar.gz is not
B. .tar puts files in a single uncompressed file; .tar.gz is compressed
C. They are the same
D. Archive Manager only handles .zip

Q2. Hard: What is the limitation of the 'Preview' mode in KompoZer regarding scripts?
A. Scripts run slower.
B. Scripts do not run.
C. Only CSS runs, not JS.
D. It opens a separate browser window.

Q3. Which statement correctly describes the 'break' statement with a label?
A. It restarts the loop at the label.
B. It transfers control out of the loop identified by the label.
C. It breaks only the innermost loop.
D. It pauses the program.

